# Storefront catalog URLs

Use these storefront paths (not admin `/products` CRUD routes):

| Page | Path |
|------|------|
| All products | `/collections/all` |
| Product detail | `/product/{urlHandle}` |
| Collections index | `/collections` |
| Collection details | `/collection/{urlHandle}` |

## Rules

- Never use `/products` or `/products/{handle}` for storefront links.
- Never use `/collections/{handle}` for a single collection — use `/collection/{urlHandle}`.
- Never use `/collection` (no trailing handle) for the collections index — use `/collections`.
- Prefer helpers from `Ziplofy/src/utils/storefront-paths.ts` or `render-store/src/utils/storefront-paths.ts` (`productPath`, `collectionPath`, `STOREFRONT_PATHS`).
- Link pickers, menus, presets, theme defaults, and runtime CTAs must follow these paths.
- Admin app routes (`/products`, `/products/:id`, `/products/collections/:id` for merchant dashboard) are separate and must not be changed for storefront links.
